<title>UK: Sony sets 150 mln Swiss franc four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sony sets 150 mln Swiss franc four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SONY CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SONY CORP</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.125 PCT MATURITY    27.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    27.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A1	  DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 GOV LAW     SWISS</p>
<p> NOTES	SONY CAPITAL CORP, DELAWARE WITH KEEPWELL AGREEMENT</p>
<p>		FROM SONY CORP TOKYO</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
